                                "sense_id": "4cf458d1-0583-315f-873f-6c582cc5628a",
                                "text": "Then he left the stage and listened to us playing highlifes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d41080f2-b6d9-4613-a925-db1fc3602ad2",
                                "sense_id": "4cf458d1-0583-315f-873f-6c582cc5628a",
                                "text": "Several of the city's most prominent ensembles started to incorporate foreign rock 'n' roll numbers into their existing repertories of ballroom, calypsos, and highlifes."
